WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:15.310
40% of the human race did not survive beyond
its 1st birthday.

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:20.640
The word time is the most commonly used noun
in the English language.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:26.940
The human heart pumps enough blood in a lifetime
to fill three supertankers.

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.820
The dialling code for Russia is 007.

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:36.500
In 2008, a man in Ohio was arrested for having
sex with a picnic table.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:42.949
The Nazis made it illegal on pain of death
for apes to give the 'Heil Hitler' salute.

00:00:42.949 --> 00:00:52.539
In Japan only 2% of adoptions are of children;
98% are adult males aged 25 to 30.

00:00:52.539 --> 00:00:59.699
Liechtenstein, the world's 6th-smallest country,
is the world's largest exporter of false teeth.

00:00:59.699 --> 00:01:06.550
10% of all the photographs in the world were
taken in the last 12 months.

00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:12.300
British spies used to use semen as invisible
ink, but they stopped because it began to

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:14.690
smell when it wasn't fresh.

00:01:14.690 --> 00:01:19.550
In the 12th century, the Danish army consisted
of seven men.

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:25.700
The ancient Romans discovered parrots could
speak and taught them to say 'Hail Caesar'.

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:40.020
But when they got bored with this, they took
to eating them instead.

